sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Browser
  participant API as Node gateway
  participant SVC as Python or Java
  participant DB as Oracle RAC
  UI->>UI: Generate UUID, save UUID and text locally
  UI->>API: POST id=123, text=hello
  API->>SVC: Forward exactly once
  SVC->>DB: INSERT with primary key 123
  DB-->>SVC: COMMIT succeeds
  SVC--xUI: Response is lost
  UI->>UI: Keep same UUID and text, outcome unknown
  UI->>API: Retry id=123, text=hello
  API->>SVC: Forward exactly once
  SVC->>DB: INSERT hits unique constraint
  SVC->>DB: ROLLBACK failed insert, SELECT id=123
  DB-->>SVC: Existing committed row
  SVC-->>UI: 200 deduplicated=true, one record
  Note over SVC,DB: Changed text with the same ID returns 409
